</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_70" data-source="" data-orig="please contact us at">please contact us at</span> <strong><a href="mailto:martin@dinweys.com">martin@dinweys.com</a></strong>.</p><h2>6. <strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_71" data-source="" data-orig="Third-Party Links">Third-Party Links</span></strong></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_72" data-source="" data-orig="The Site may contain links to third-party websites">The Site may contain links to third-party websites</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_73" data-source="" data-orig="We are not responsible for the privacy practices or content of those websites">We are not responsible for the privacy practices or content of those websites</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_74" data-source="" data-orig="Please review their privacy policies when you visit them">Please review their privacy policies when you visit them</span>.</p><h2>7. <strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_75" data-source="" data-orig="Children’s Privacy">Children’s Privacy</span></strong></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_76" data-source="" data-orig="Our services are not intended for individuals under the age of">Our services are not intended for individuals under the age of</span> 13. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_77" data-source="" data-orig="We do not knowingly collect personal information from children">We do not knowingly collect personal information from children</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_78" data-source="" data-orig="If you believe we have collected information from a child">If you believe we have collected information from a child</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_79" data-source="" data-orig="please contact us so we can take appropriate action">please contact us so we can take appropriate action</span>.</p><h2>8. <strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_80" data-source="" data-orig="Changes to This Privacy Policy">Changes to This Privacy Policy</span></strong></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_81" data-source="" data-orig="We may update this P